  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "Isaiah supplies the only occurrence of מַתְבֵּן. The Arabic and Maltese parallels name a storage place, while Isaiah’s image points to the straw being trodden. The name Tibni may contain the straw noun. The index also groups Tiglath-pileser, Togarmah, Thebez, Tadmor and Tidal here by spelling."
